<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's foreign reserves rise to 1.975 bln dinar.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's foreign reserves rise to 1.975 bln dinar.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's total foreign exchange reserves were 1.972 billion dinars at December 20, 1996 from 1.801 billion dinars at November 30, Central Bank figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>    TUNISIA RESERVES    Dec 20  Nov 30  Oct 31  Dec 31,95</p>
<p>    Gold and Foreign     1,951   1,801   1,747    1,530</p>
<p>    SDRs			  21	 7	28	 12</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of dinars and subject to rounding.</p>
<p>($=1.08 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
